== Effects ==
* Grants 5 {{e|Bomb}}s.
* Gives all of Isaac's bombs increased damage and blast radius.
** {{dlc|nr}} Mr. Mega bombs deal 110 damage instead of 60.
** {{dlc|r}} Mr. Mega bombs deal 185 damage instead of 100.
* When bombs explode, the screen will shake.

== Notes ==
* This item can drop from killing {{E|Super Wrath}}. {{dlc|nr}} Super Wrath can drop this item even if Isaac has already encountered/possessed it. 
** Stacking multiple copies of Mr. Mega doesn't increase bomb damage.
* {{dlc+|r+}} This item can be crafted by {{i|Bag of Crafting}} with eight {{e|Bomb}}s.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Bob's Brain}}: Increases damage {{dlc|nr}} from 60 to 145 {{dlc|r}} from 100 to 150.
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}: Adds 25 flat damage to bomb explosions.
* {{I|Ghost Bombs}}: Ghosts appear larger and do extra damage only upon exploding.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Anarchist Cookbook}}: No effect.
* {{i|Bob's Rotten Head}}: No effect.
* {{i|Epic Fetus}}: No effect.
* {{i|Number Two}} / {{i|Curse of the Tower}}: Not affected by Mr. Mega.

